JSX (`TopAlertZonesChart.jsx` lines 27–30): track has `aria-hidden="true"`, inner fill is an inline `style={{ width: ... }}`; the numeric value lives in a sibling `<span aria-label="...">` — data is never encoded only via width.

Vertical stacked bar (`AlertTrendChart.jsx`, lines 749–768):
```css
